#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.rpartition.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.rpartition"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.rpartition:1
msgid "Split the string at the last occurrence of `sep`."
msgstr "在最后一个 `sep` 出现的位置分割字符串。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.rpartition:3
msgid ""
"This method splits the string at the last occurrence of `sep`, and "
"returns 3 elements containing the part before the separator, the "
"separator itself, and the part after the separator. If the separator is "
"not found, return 3 elements containing two empty strings, followed by "
"the string itself."
msgstr ""
"此方法在最后一个 `sep` 出现的位置分割字符串，并返回 3 个元素，分别包含"
"分隔符之前的部分、分隔符本身和分隔符之后的部分。如果未找到分隔符，则返回 "
"3 个元素，前两个是空字符串，最后一个是字符串本身。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.rpartition.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.rpartition:9
msgid "String to split on."
msgstr "用于分割的字符串。"

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.rpartition:11
msgid ""
"If True, return DataFrame/MultiIndex expanding dimensionality. If False, "
"return Series/Index."
msgstr ""
"如果为 True，返回扩展维度的 DataFrame/MultiIndex。如果为 False，返回 "
"Series/Index。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.str.rpartition.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: of pandas.core.strings.accessor.StringMethods.rpartition:15
msgid ""
"Returns appropriate type based on `expand` parameter with strings split "
"based on the `sep` parameter."
msgstr "根据 `expand` 参数返回适当的类型，并基于 `sep` 参数分割字符串。"

